  "translations": {
    "## What's Changed * chore: resolve @modelcontextprotocol/sdk to 1.26.0 by @pedroccastro in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27640 * fix: update booking page terms text to use APP_NAME instead of \"our\" by @CarinaWolli in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27834 * fix: add i18n + migration for booking history pbac by @se": "发布说明摘译：将 @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 解析至 1.26.0（#27640）；预约页条款改用 APP_NAME 代替 our（#27834）；为预约历史 PBAC 增加国际化和迁移，后续说明被截断。",
    "## What's Changed * fix: (booking-audit) Remove IS_PRODUCTION gate and add feature flag check in producer by @hariombalhara in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/26524 * fix: allow unmarking host as no-show by @hariombalhara in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27694 * feat: show routing trace dialog on assignment reaso": "发布说明摘译：预约审计移除 IS_PRODUCTION 条件，并在生产者中增加功能开关检查（#26524）；允许取消主持人的未出席标记（#27694）；增加路由追踪对话框，后续说明被截断。",
    "## What's Changed * fix: Booking Drawer - text overlap in footer by @hariombalhara in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27897 * refactor: migrate Icon to component icons from @coss/ui/icons by @eunjae-lee in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27458 * feat: active user billing by @sean-brydon in https://github.com/calcom": "发布说明摘译：修复预约抽屉底部文字重叠（#27897）；将图标迁移至 @coss/ui/icons 组件（#27458）；新增按活跃用户计费功能，后续链接被截断。",
    "## What's Changed * fix: show invite link settings modal when clicking edit invite link in team members view by @anikdhabal in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27917 * fix: exclude test files from CODEOWNERS foundation approval by @hariombalhara in https://github.com/calcom/cal.com/pull/27919 * fix(app-store): preserve exi": "发布说明摘译：在团队成员视图点击编辑邀请链接时显示设置弹窗（#27917）；将测试文件排除在 CODEOWNERS 基础审批之外（#27919）。后续应用商店修复被截断。",
    "Blog - Explore Insights, Updates, and Use Cases | Cal.com": "Cal.com 博客与内容",
    "Cal.com | Scheduling Software for Online Bookings": "Cal.com 官网",
    "Introduction to API v2 - Cal.com Docs": "Cal.com 文档与更新",
    "Pricing | Cal.com": "Cal.com 定价与方案",
    "README 内容摘录：> [!WARNING] > Use at your own risk. Cal.diy is the open source community edition of Cal.com and it is intended for users who want to self-host their own Cal.diy instance. It is strictly recommended for personal, non-production us": "README 摘录（中文）：警告：请自行承担使用风险。Cal.diy 是 Cal.com 的开源社区版，面向希望自托管实例的用户。原文强烈建议仅用于个人、非生产环境；末尾被截断。",
    "The highest-rated scheduling system that helps you grow your business and better find time.": "日程预约系统，帮助用户安排时间并发展业务；官网称其拥有很高的用户评价。",
