    "定价页中的原始片段：mport Calendly events Teams Yearly $12 per user/month Save 25% For small teams & startups with combined；s Custom APIs Organizations Yearly $28 per user/month Save 25% For larger teams looking for more contro；ls Free forever Use for free Teams $12 per month/user Try for free Organizations $28 per month/user Try": "定价页摘录（中文）：个人方案永久免费。Teams 按年付费时每名用户每月 12 美元，标注节省 25%，适合小团队和初创企业。Organizations 按年付费时每名用户每月 28 美元，标注节省 25%，面向需要更多控制能力的大团队。"
